{
  "conversations": [
    {
      "conversationId": "infernus_victor_convo03",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Infernus",
          "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_01.mp3",
          "text": "You figure out where any of you came from yet?",
          "duration": 1.889
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Victor",
          "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_02.mp3",
          "text": "No.",
          "duration": 0.818
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Infernus",
          "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_03.mp3",
          "text": "I'm sorry man.",
          "duration": 1.119
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Victor",
          "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_04.mp3",
          "text": "For a while I thought my left foot belonged to an accordion player in Milwaukee that was ritually murdered\u2026 turns out he had already lost the foot to gangreen , so that was 4 hours on a greyhound I'm never getting back.",
          "duration": 9.613
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Infernus",
          "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_05.mp3",
          "text": "Oh\u2026",
          "duration": 0.848
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Victor",
          "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_06.mp3",
          "text": "This other time there was a dad in-",
          "duration": 1.784
        },
        {
          "order": 7,
          "character": "Infernus",
          "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_07",
          "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_frank_inferno_convo03_07.mp3",
          "text": "Hey, they uh, ritual is starting\u2026",
          "duration": 2.05
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "kelvin_victor_convo01",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Kelvin",
          "audioFile": "kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "Look at us: a couple of walking corpes ready to stare death in the eye",
          "duration": 5.195
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Victor",
          "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "You seem fairly cheerful about it.",
          "duration": 2.261
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Kelvin",
          "audioFile": "kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "Why not?  It's better than the alternative.",
          "duration": 2.763
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Victor",
          "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_04.mp3",
          "text": "You have no issues with being a grotesque mirror of humanity.",
          "duration": 3.148
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Kelvin",
          "audioFile": "kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_05.mp3",
          "text": "My friend: we were gifted unnatural life.  Don't squander it, travel.  Write a book.  Find love.",
          "duration": 9.416
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Victor",
          "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo01_06.mp3",
          "text": "I'm not taking advice from someone wearing a parka in New York.",
          "duration": 3.07
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "kelvin_victor_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Kelvin",
          "audioFile": "kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "Do you have a plan for the battle, my morose friend.",
          "duration": 2.682
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Victor",
          "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "My plans tend to devolve into me throwing my body at my enemies until we all drown in blood.",
          "duration": 5.092
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Kelvin",
          "audioFile": "kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo02_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/kelvin_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo02_03.mp3",
          "text": "That doesn't sound very sustainable.",
          "duration": 2.624
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Victor",
          "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_kelvin_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "Ideally I rise like a macabre pheonix, but it doesn't always work  out.",
          "duration": 4.3
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}